<section class="hero-home"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow">WEALTH PLANNING FOR BUSINESS OWNERS</div><h1>What do you want your money <em>to do for you?</em></h1><p class="lead">You’ve built something meaningful. Let’s connect your business, personal wealth, and next chapter into one clear picture.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn" href="/assessment/">Discover Your Wealth Persona</a><a class="text-link" href="/how-we-work/">See How We Work</a></div><p class="hero-note">Fort Collins, Colorado · Independent wealth planning</p></div><div class="hero-photo"><img src="/images/ripl-photos-077.jpg" alt="The RIPL team together in their Fort Collins office" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="hero-tag">A firm you would actually want to sit down with.</div></div></section>
<section class="manifesto"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">THE FULL PICTURE</div><h2 class="big-statement">You built the business.<br/><span>Let’s bring the rest together.</span></h2><div class="manifesto-grid"><p class="lead">Your CPA sees the taxes. Your attorney sees the documents. Your investments live somewhere else. Who’s connecting it all?</p><div><p>We help you see how the pieces fit: what your business needs, what your family needs, and what your money needs to make possible.</p><p>Smart people make excellent decisions when they can see all of their options.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section dark"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">THE RIPL APPROACH</div><div class="questions-head"><h2>Clarity before<br/>the next decision.</h2><p>Most advisors start with your assets. we start with your life. That one difference changes every decision that follows.</p></div><div class="pillar-grid"><a href="/how-we-work/" class="pillar"><span class="num">01 / CLARITY</span><h3>We turn complexity to clarity.</h3><p>See what you have, how money moves, and which decisions deserve your attention first.</p><span class="pillar-link">Explore SAGE Planning</span></a><a href="/wealth/" class="pillar"><span class="num">02 / TIMING</span><h3>We redefine risk.</h3><p>Your money needs to be ready when you are. We connect investments to timelines, liquidity needs, and the risks that could interrupt your plan.</p><span class="pillar-link">Explore Advantage Investing</span></a><a href="/structured-notes/" class="pillar"><span class="num">03 / CHOICE</span><h3>We expand your toolbox.</h3><p>Compare the tools that fit the job. Understand the tradeoffs. Every decision stays exactly where it belongs. With you.</p><span class="pillar-link">Explore Investment Tools</span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="section questions"><div class="wrap"><div class="questions-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">START WITH YOUR QUESTION</div><h2>What’s on<br/>your mind?</h2></div><p>You don’t need the terminology or a perfectly organized balance sheet. Start with the decision in front of you.</p></div><div class="grid"><a class="card" href="/business-owners/excess-business-cash/"><span class="num">01</span><h3>What should I do with excess business cash?</h3><p>Separate operating needs from capital that can serve another purpose.</p></a><a class="card" href="/business-owners/build-wealth-outside-business/"><span class="num">02</span><h3>How do I build wealth outside my business?</h3><p>Give your personal balance sheet the same attention as your company.</p></a><a class="card" href="/business-owners/before-selling-business/"><span class="num">03</span><h3>What should I do before selling my business?</h3><p>Plan for the wealth before the transaction becomes irreversible.</p></a><a class="card" href="/business-owners/after-selling-business/"><span class="num">04</span><h3>What happens after the sale?</h3><p>Connect the proceeds to your income, family, and next chapter.</p></a><a class="card" href="/money-questions/reduce-investment-taxes/"><span class="num">05</span><h3>Are my taxes and investments working together?</h3><p>Bring your investment decisions and CPA into the same conversation.</p></a><a class="card" href="/capital-clarity/"><span class="num">06</span><h3>My money is spread out everywhere.</h3><p>See the accounts as one financial life.</p></a></div><div class="cta"><a class="btn ghost" href="/business-owners/10-money-questions/">Explore 10 Business Owner Questions</a></div></div></section>
<section class="assessment-band"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">A THREE-MINUTE START</div><h2>What’s your<br/>wealth persona?</h2></div><div><p class="lead">Find out how the way you think about money is shaping your future.</p><p>See your strengths, the patterns worth questioning, and a few ideas for your next stage.</p><a class="btn" href="/assessment/">Let’s Find Out</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">WHERE YOU ARE TODAY</div><h2>More than one stage<br/>can feel like you.</h2><p class="lead">Building, accumulating, navigating, and giving often happen at the same time. Your plan should reflect that.</p><div class="stage-grid"><div><span>01</span><h3>The Builder</h3><p>You’re reinvesting in what you’re creating. The personal side needs to keep pace.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>The Accumulator</h3><p>Income is arriving faster than the structure around it. Put the next dollar to work with intention.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>The Navigator</h3><p>A sale, retirement, or life change has raised new questions. Decide what needs attention first.</p></div><div><span>04</span><h3>The Steward</h3><p>You’re thinking beyond yourself. Connect your wealth to family, community, and lasting impact.</p></div></div></div></section>
